    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique game mechanic where when lining up jumps time slows down to help navigate tricky sections and dodge dangerous obstacles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a beautiful immersive world brought alive through high-quality unique 2D art. Enjoy the dynamic day night cycle, unique lighting effects, and varied environmental &amp; weather systems that help make the world as engaging, stunning, and immersive as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy today and start Leena's adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 10 levels, I plan to  increase this over time. Please bear with me.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique game mechanic where when lining up jumps time slows down to help navigate tricky sections and dodge dangerous obstacles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a beautiful immersive world brought alive through high-quality unique 2D art. Enjoy the dynamic day night cycle, unique lighting effects, and varied environmental &amp; weather systems that help make the world as engaging, stunning, and immersive as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy today and start Leena's adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 10 levels, I plan to  increase this over time. Please bear with me.</p>",
